<title>USA: USDA signs PL480 pact with Armenia for $15 mln.</title>
<headline>USDA signs PL480 pact with Armenia for $15 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Monday said it signed a PL 480, Title 1 sales pact with Armenia for the sale of $15 million worth of U.S. wheat and related transportation costs for fiscal year 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said the action provides for the sale of about 60,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat. Purchase authorizations will be announced as issued, and sales will be made by private U.S. traders on a competitive basis, it said.</p>
<p>USDA said the supply period is fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
